-    $$ g_{j+1}(i, j, k) = \sum_{m=-2}^{2} \sum_{n=-2}^{2} \sum_{p=-2}^{2} w(m) w(n) w(p) \cdot g_j(2i+m, 2j+n, 2k+p) $$
